#. module: esg
#: model_terms:knowledge.article,template_body:esg.esg_csrd_knowledge_article_template_csrd_esrs_e2
msgid ""
"Actions are backed by dedicated resources, cross-functional teams,\n"
"                                and capital\n"
"                                investment. Link actions clearly to the "
"corresponding pollution\n"
"                                policies (E2-1)."
msgstr ""
"ການປະຕິບັດແມ່ນໄດ້ຮັບການສະໜັບສະໜູນຈາກຊັບພະຍາກອນສະເພາະ, ທີມງານຮ່ວມສາຍງານ ແລະ ການລົງທຶນ. ຄວນ"
"ເຊື່ອມໂຍງການປະຕິບັດຢ່າງຈະແຈ້ງກັບນະໂຍບາຍມົນລະພິດທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງ (E2-1)."

#. module: esg
#: model_terms:ir.actions.act_window,help:esg.action_view_esg_action
msgid ""
"Actions are the specific steps or measures that an organization takes to "
"implement its ESG strategy.\n"
"                They are the actionable items that help achieve its ESG "
"goals, including the targets set to track progress over time."
msgstr ""
"ການປະຕິບັດແມ່ນຂັ້ນຕອນ ຫຼື ມາດຕະການສະເພາະທີ່ອົງກອນດຳເນີນເພື່ອຈັດຕັ້ງປະຕິບັດຍຸດທະສາດ ESG ຂອງຕົນ. ສິ່ງ"
"ເຫຼົ່ານີ້ແມ່ນລາຍການທີ່ສາມາດປະຕິບັດໄດ້ຕົວຈິງເພື່ອຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ບັນລຸເປົ້າໝາຍ ESG, ລວມທັງເປົ້າໝາຍທີ່ຕັ້ງໄວ້ເພື່ອຕິດຕາມ"
"ຄວາມຄືບໜ້າຕາມໄລຍະເວລາ."

#. module: esg
#: model_terms:knowledge.article,template_body:esg.esg_csrd_knowledge_article_template_csrd_esrs_e3
msgid ""
"Actions focus on <strong>avoiding</strong>, <strong>reducing</strong>,\n"
"                                and <strong>\n"
"                                    restoring</strong> water and marine "
"impacts. Resources are\n"
"                                allocated through environmental budgets, "
"with performance monitored\n"
"                                via specific water-related KPIs."
msgstr ""
"ການປະຕິບັດສຸມໃສ່ການ <strong>ຫຼີກລ່ຽງ</strong>, <strong>ຫຼຸດຜ່ອນ</strong>, ແລະ <strong>ຟື້"
"ນຟູ</strong> ຜົນກະທົບຕໍ່ນ້ຳ ແລະ ຊັບພະຍາກອນທາງທະເລ. ຊັບພະຍາກອນໄດ້ຖືກຈັດສັນຜ່ານງົບປະມານດ້ານສິ່ງແ"
"ວດລ້ອມ, ໂດຍມີການຕິດຕາມຜົນງານຜ່ານ KPI ສະເພາະທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງກັບນ້ຳ."

#. module: esg
#: model_terms:knowledge.article,template_body:esg.esg_csrd_knowledge_article_template_csrd_esrs_e4
msgid ""
"Actions follow the mitigation hierarchy: avoidance, reduction,\n"
"                                restoration, and\n"
"                                offsetting. Local communities and indigenous "
"knowledge are\n"
"                                incorporated.\n"
"                                Biodiversity offsets are documented with "
"area, type, quality\n"
"                                criteria, and\n"
"                                standards."
msgstr ""
"ການປະຕິບັດແມ່ນປະຕິບັດຕາມລຳດັບຂັ້ນການຫຼຸດຜ່ອນຜົນກະທົບຄື: ການຫຼີກລ່ຽງ, ການຫຼຸດຜ່ອນ, ການຟື້ນຟູ ແລະ ການຊົ"
"ດເຊີຍ. ຊຸມຊົນທ້ອງຖິ່ນ ແລະ ພູມປັນຍາທ້ອງຖິ່ນໄດ້ຖືກເຊື່ອມໂຍງເຂົ້າກັນ. ການຊົດເຊີຍດ້ານຊີວະນາໆພັນແມ່ນຖືກບັນທຶກ"
"ໄວ້ພ້ອມດ້ວຍຂໍ້ມູນເນື້ອທີ່, ປະເພດ, ເກນຄຸນນະພາບ ແລະ ມາດຕະຖານ."

#. module: esg
#: model_terms:knowledge.article,template_body:esg.esg_csrd_knowledge_article_template_vsm_b7
msgid ""
"Actions implemented by {{ company_name }} to support its circular economy "
"approach and improve waste management:"
msgstr ""
"ການປະຕິບັດທີ່ຈັດຕັ້ງປະຕິບັດໂດຍ {{ company_name }} ເພື່ອສະໜັບສະໜູນແນວທາງເສດຖະກິດໝູນວຽນ ແລະ ປັບ"
"ປຸງການຄຸ້ມຄອງຂີ້ເຫຍື້ອ:"

#. module: esg
#: model_terms:knowledge.article,template_body:esg.esg_csrd_knowledge_article_template_csrd_esrs_s4
msgid ""
"Actions include\n"
"                                            product redesigns,\n"
"                                            privacy-compliance programs, "
"recall campaigns, and\n"
"                                            consumer education\n"
"                                            initiatives. Effectiveness is "
"measured by reductions in\n"
"                                            complaints,\n"
"                                            improved satisfaction, and "
"compliance with safety\n"
"                                            regulations."
msgstr ""
