"                        value-chain coverage — upstream and downstream "
"activities included</em>]</strong>\n"
"                        ."
msgstr ""
"ຖະແຫຼງການຄວາມຍືນຍົງກວມເອົາ <strong>[<em>ອະທິບາຍຂອບເຂດຂອງ\n"
"                        ການກວມລວມຕ່ອງໂສ້ມູນຄ່າ — ລວມທັງກິດຈະກຳຂັ້ນຕົ້ນນ້ຳ ແລະ ປາຍນ້ຳ</em>"
"]</strong>\n"
"                        ."

#. module: esg
#: model_terms:knowledge.article,template_body:esg.esg_csrd_knowledge_article_template_csrd_basic_for_prepation
