msgid "“Other” gender employees in the base year"
msgstr "ພະນັກງານເພດ “ອື່ນໆ” ໃນປີພື້ນຖານ"

#. module: esg
#: model_terms:knowledge.article,template_body:esg.esg_csrd_knowledge_article_template_csrd_appendix_placeholders
#: model_terms:knowledge.article,template_body:esg.esg_csrd_knowledge_article_template_vsm_appendix_b
msgid "“Other” gender employees in the reporting year"
msgstr "ພະນັກງານເພດ “ອື່ນໆ” ໃນປີລາຍງານ"

#. module: esg
#: model_terms:knowledge.article,template_body:esg.esg_csrd_knowledge_article_template_vsm_b8
msgid "“Other” includes legally recognized third genders where applicable."
msgstr "“ອື່ນໆ” ລວມເຖິງເພດທີສາມທີ່ໄດ້ຮັບການຮັບຮອງຕາມກົດໝາຍໃນກໍລະນີທີ່ມີ."

#. module: esg
#: model_terms:knowledge.article,template_body:esg.esg_csrd_knowledge_article_template_vsm_c5
msgid ""
"“Other” includes legally recognized third genders; “Not reported” for "
"employees who chose not to disclose."
msgstr ""
"“ອື່ນໆ” ລວມເຖິງເພດທີສາມທີ່ໄດ້ຮັບການຮັບຮອງຕາມກົດໝາຍ; “ບໍ່ໄດ້ລາຍງານ” ສຳລັບພະນັກງານທີ່ເລືອກບໍ່ເປີດເຜີ"
"ຍ."

#. module: esg
#: model_terms:knowledge.article,template_body:esg.esg_csrd_knowledge_article_template_vsm_b5
msgid ""
"“Sensitive areas” typically include Natura 2000, Ramsar sites, UNESCO "
"reserves, or equivalent national designations."
msgstr ""
"“ພື້ນທີ່ອ່ອນໄຫວ” ໂດຍທົ່ວໄປແລ້ວລວມມີ Natura 2000, ພື້ນທີ່ Ramsar, ເຂດສະຫງວນຂອງ UNESCO, ຫຼື ພື້ນ"
"ທີ່ທີ່ໄດ້ຮັບການກຳນົດທຽບເທົ່າໃນລະດັບຊາດ."
